# F-Zero GX+, by Emarcee: a rebalance of F-Zero GX's machines and custom parts, and the dash plate's boost and the
# machine setting's drift its main module changes.
# Included with the author's permission. Credit: Emarcee.
#
# This file holds the mod's changed values only: the 2,062 words of its car data file that differ from the disc's
# (F-Zero GX, USA), in all 41 machines and all 75 custom parts (Super Piranha's TurnDeceleration of -0.02 among them:
# a negative value where the disc has none, which packs may hold, handbook/stat-packs.md); and the
# allowed rules its main module changes (handbook/stat-pack-constants.md): the dash plate's boost, the same code as
# GX Unleashed's, int(30 + 15 x boost duration), carried as DashPlateBase and DashPlateScale; and one number of the
# machine setting's curve, .text+0x22B48 in fn_1_22B10 (lfs f4,0x7C(r4) -> lfs f4,0xE8(r4)): on the max speed side
# the drift acceleration's loss D -= 1.8 x D x d becomes D -= 1.0 x D x d, carried as DriftFastLoss. Its boost
# energy and speed cap are the disc's. The mod's files are not in this repository, and nothing of the game's own
# data is in this file.
#
# What the mod changes that this pack does not carry (presentation only): Death Anchor named "Soldier Anchor"
# (.data 0x2017C, 0x27EBC), the grades of machines 12 and 38 (.data 0x416B8), the menus' stat text (.data 0x28060).
#
# Made by the launcher's import from a copy of the mod's files (cardata.lz SHA-1
# 5e08be8da55011bb24685aafceffa9afa884d969, line__.bin SHA-1 1ca031e2e49cb0aa7ceb58e7a3257f64ebfab30c) against the
# unchanged disc image:
#   Launcher.App --import-stat-pack cardata.lz --main-module line__.bin --disc "F-Zero GX (USA).iso" --pack-name "F-Zero GX+" --pack-author Emarcee --out fzero-gx-plus.fzstats
# Its fingerprint: 783e8adf67b256e92500a095ceea1c6ce9c76b55. Not to be changed by hand: another value is another
# pack, which every game of a race must hold alike (handbook/stat-packs.md).
fzstats 1
name F-Zero GX+
author Emarcee
